<title>UK: J.P Morgan leads 720 bln lire asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>J.P Morgan leads 720 bln lire asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>asset-backed bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCCR SERIES 2 CAPITAL ONE LTD (JERSEY)</p>
<p> AMT    720 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1.0 BP   PAY DATE  S-19.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA (EXP) ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-100     SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	BORROWER IS A JERSEY BASED SPECIAL PURPOSE COMPANY.</p>
<p>		ISSUE COLLATERALIZED BY US$ CLASS A CERTIFICATES</p>
<p>		ISSUED BY CAPITAL ONE MASTER CREDIT CARD TRUST.</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
